  "notes": "Transcribed from Yugipedia page 'March 2010 Lists (TCG)' (MediaWiki parse API); the page cites Konami's own list (see the source registry entries). Names resolved to passcodes against ProjectIgnis/BabelCDB cards.cdb, preferring base printings (alias=0). Yugipedia also records: no_longer_on_list = ['Mask of Darkness', 'Smashing Ground']. VERIFIED 2026-09-01: the archived Konami primary source (konami-limited-2010-03, Advanced Format Limited & Forbidden Lists, Wayback snapshot 2010-08-25) explicitly covers the March 1, 2010 Advanced Format list; all 132 canonical entries (43 forbidden, 70 limited, 19 semi-limited) matched exactly by name and status in both directions, with zero cards on either side only and zero status mismatches. The source's own No Longer on List section also matches the note above. effective_date (2010-03-01) is stated on that primary page. superseded_by_date (2010-09-01) is supported by the archived official successor PDF konami-limited-2010-09, whose title states Effective September 1, 2010; the August 25 capture date is not being used as an effective date."
}
